# LU4-RB — core

Raid boss respawn tracker for Lineage 2 LU4.

## Stack

- Next.js App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS v4
- shadcn/ui (`base-nova`, Radix) — prefer existing UI components
- Supabase Auth + Postgres + RLS
- Deploy on Vercel; PWA-capable (`manifest.webmanifest`)

## Layout

- App code under `src/`
- Supabase clients: `src/lib/supabase/`
- Timer logic: `src/lib/timers.ts`
- DB: `supabase/migrations/`, seed via `supabase/seed.sql`

## Auth

- Shared clan login (email/password) via Supabase Auth
- Protect routes in `src/proxy.ts` using `getClaims()`
- Never trust `getSession()` alone for authorization

## Git Flow

- `main` — production
- `develop` — integration
- `feature/*` from `develop`, PR into `develop`
- Release: PR `develop` → `main`
- Conventional commits: `feat:`, `fix:`, `chore:`

## Secrets

- Never commit `.env`, game account credentials, or service role keys
- `AUTH_USER` / `AUTH_PASSWORD` are ops-only (shared login); do not bake into client bundles
- Do not store Excel «Лог/Пасс» columns anywhere in the app
